00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:33,000
They have one shot to show their spots.

2
00:08:54,000 --> 00:09:00,000
The Cheetah Girls is a family, comedy, drama film directed by Oz Scott.

3
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:27,000
A four-member teen girl group named the Cheetah Girls go to a Manhattan High School for the Performing
Arts and try to become the first freshmen to win the talent show in the school's history.

4
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,000
During the talent show auditions, they meet a big-time producer named Jackal Johnson, who
tries to make the group into superstars, but the girls run into many problems.

5
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:21,000
Galleria Garibaldi, played by Raven-Symoné.

6
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Chanel Simmons, played by Adrienne Bailon-Houghton.

7
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:15,000
Aqua Walker, played by Kiely Williams.

8
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Dorinda Thomas, played by Sabrina Bryan.

9
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:09,000
Dorothea Garibaldi, played by Lynn Whitfield.

10
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:36,000
Drinka Champagne, played by Sandra Caldwell.

11
00:48:57,000 --> 00:49:03,000
The Cheetah Girls is a 2003 American musical television film directed by Oz Scott
and based on the book series of the same name by Deborah Gregory.

12
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:30,000
The Cheetah Girls was the first musical Disney Channel Original Movie.

13
00:57:51,000 --> 00:57:57,000
Upon release, the film was the number one rated basic cable telecast and
premiered to 6.5 million viewers, a record for Disney at the time.

14
01:02:18,000 --> 01:02:24,000
The movie's DVD sold over 800,000 copies.

15
01:06:45,000 --> 01:06:51,000
The film's soundtrack was released on August 12, 2003.

16
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:18,000
It peaked at number 33 on the Billboard 200 and was
certified double platinum by the RIAA.

17
01:15:39,000 --> 01:15:45,000
Following the success of the film, Disney began developing The
Cheetah Girls as a real-life recording group.

18
01:20:06,000 --> 01:20:12,000
The film explores themes of high school, based on novel or
book, musical, talent show, best friend.

19
01:24:33,000 --> 01:24:39,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
